{"nodes": [{"id": "context_emobilize", "label": "Emobilize", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Android app built with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose, not React, Tailwind, or Figma Make. Agents that change UI must read CONTEXT.md and DESIGN.md first and must ignore the user-level AGENTS.md, which belongs to a different web project. Change appearance only; do not change save behavior, filters, or architecture. Existing UI copy stays English. Branch tasks-radial-menu. Remote https://github.com/Hzxon/Emobilize. Package ayodong.emobilize. One Gradle module :app. minSdk 28. compileSdk and targetSdk 37."}, {"id": "context_layered_architecture", "label": "Layered architecture", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The dependency direction is UI to ViewModel to use case to repository interface to data. Domain must not import Compose. TasksViewModel is the only ViewModel and it re-reads the repository after a write. There is no Hilt, and a DI library must not be added."}, {"id": "context_mainactivity", "label": "MainActivity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L139", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Creates AppContainer, then obtains the ViewModel with viewModel(factory = TasksViewModelFactory(container))."}, {"id": "context_appcontainer", "label": "AppContainer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L37", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Manual composition root in di/AppContainer.kt. It exists because the app does not use Hilt."}, {"id": "context_tasksviewmodel", "label": "TasksViewModel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L137", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only ViewModel. Composables must not change data state; that state lives here. After a write it re-reads the repository. deleteSelectedBlock() removes the selected calendar block. Do not open the ViewModel just to change card color or spacing. TaskDraft stays in this file."}, {"id": "context_taskdraft", "label": "TaskDraft", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L137", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kept in TasksViewModel.kt because its fields are mutableStateOf. It must not be moved into domain."}, {"id": "context_composable_state", "label": "Composable UI state", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L141", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only state a Composable may own is themeId, the active tab, and menuOpen. A Composable must not persist tasks or blocks and must not build the task list or calendar blocks."}, {"id": "context_task", "label": "Task", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L145", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Domain model in domain/model/Task.kt. category and priority may be null. An empty deadline means no date. range holds a time range. eventType is Event, Task, or Regular Schedule. time and eventEndTime look like 10:30 AM; range fields look like 09:00."}, {"id": "context_timeblock", "label": "TimeBlock", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L153", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fields are id, title, start, end as decimal hours, and category. Stored per LocalDate. Shown on the calendar as a Regular Schedule block."}, {"id": "context_eventtype", "label": "EventType", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L150", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The three kinds are Event, Task, and Regular Schedule. Calendar Add offers only Event and Regular Schedule; Task is not in that form. Editing an existing calendar item locks the type."}, {"id": "context_legacy_models", "label": "Legacy model package", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L157", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "model/TaskModels.kt and model/CalendarModels.kt are old duplicates and are not imported. Live models are under domain/model/. Do not edit the legacy files."}, {"id": "context_inmemory_persistence", "label": "In-memory persistence", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L100", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The product is a task and calendar app. Data is held in memory and is lost when the process dies. Sample content lives in SampleData.kt."}, {"id": "context_sampledata", "label": "SampleData", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L43", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Seed content for the in-memory repositories. It is not a persistence layer."}, {"id": "context_inmemorytaskrepository", "label": "InMemoryTaskRepository", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L44", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Data-layer task repository. It sits behind the repository interface and holds tasks only in memory."}, {"id": "context_inmemoryschedulerepository", "label": "InMemoryScheduleRepository", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L45", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Data-layer schedule repository. It sits behind the repository interface and holds schedule data only in memory."}, {"id": "context_taskusecases", "label": "TaskUseCases", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L41", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Domain use-case layer for tasks, between the ViewModel and the repository interface. Domain code must not import Compose."}, {"id": "context_scheduleusecases", "label": "ScheduleUseCases", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L42", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Domain use-case layer for the schedule, between the ViewModel and the repository interface."}, {"id": "context_repositories", "label": "Repository interfaces", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L40", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "domain/repository/Repositories.kt is the interface the use cases depend on. TasksViewModel re-reads through this boundary after a write. Implementations are the in-memory repositories."}, {"id": "context_emobilizeapp", "label": "EmobilizeApp", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Composes every screen and decides when a form appears. It is the UI root of the layered flow and must not own task or block data."}, {"id": "context_settingsscreen", "label": "SettingsScreen", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "App preferences and categories. The gear icon in the header opens Settings. Theme is changed only from Settings."}, {"id": "context_tasksscreen", "label": "TasksScreen", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Task list, filters, and TaskCard. Filters are All, Today, Tomorrow, and Later. A card shows a category line, a priority badge, and a date only when that field exists. A task with no schedule appears only under All."}, {"id": "context_addtaskcard", "label": "AddTaskCard", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L110", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Add surface on the Tasks tab only. The title is focused and the keyboard opens. Optional icons are Category, Priority, and Schedule. Schedule is Deadline or Time range, and tapping the same choice clears it. Close, an outside tap, or back saves when the title is filled; an empty title only dismisses. An invalid time range keeps the card open."}, {"id": "context_taskformsheet", "label": "TaskFormSheet", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L114", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Full sheet for editing a task, including DateField and TimeField. Edit does not reuse AddTaskCard."}, {"id": "context_calendarformsheet", "label": "CalendarFormSheet", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L126", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Add and edit on the Calendar tab. It is not AddTaskCard. Add offers only Event and Regular Schedule; Task is absent. Editing an existing item locks the type to that item."}, {"id": "context_calendarscreen", "label": "CalendarScreen", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L116", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Month, Week, and Day, plus DayAgenda and AgendaRow. Under the date picker is a vertical card list, not an hour grid. Items sort by start time and timeless items go last. An empty day says Nothing scheduled. A block shows Regular Schedule, category, and start-to-end time. A task shows EventType, category, priority when set, and date or time. Edit and Delete select a card."}, {"id": "context_bottomdock", "label": "BottomDock", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L81", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bottom dock with the Tasks and Calendar tabs, the center button face FabFace, and the theme orb ThemeOrb. The center button opens the radial menu."}, {"id": "context_radialmenu", "label": "RadialMenu", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L129", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Actions are Add, Update, Edit, and Delete. Update is hidden on the Calendar tab. Animation is a spring with dampingRatio 0.75 and Spring.StiffnessMediumLow: the fan grows from the hub, buttons rise from the dock, and icons rotate 90 degrees. Do not replace these actions with a navigation menu."}, {"id": "context_menucolor", "label": "menuColor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L94", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CONTEXT assigns radial actions as Add green, Update blue, Edit actionEdit, and Delete danger. DESIGN.md instead maps add to primary, update to chart-3, edit to chart-4, and delete to destructive. Those two accounts do not match."}, {"id": "context_localpalette", "label": "LocalPalette", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L89", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Screen colors come from LocalPalette.current in ui/theme/Palette.kt. There are exactly two themes, NeutralLight id 1 and NeutralDark id 2. Do not add a palette. Token values are specified in DESIGN.md."}, {"id": "context_neutrallight", "label": "NeutralLight", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L89", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Light theme, palette id 1, provided by LocalPalette."}, {"id": "context_neutraldark", "label": "NeutralDark", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L89", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dark theme, palette id 2, provided by LocalPalette."}, {"id": "context_appmetrics", "label": "AppMetrics", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L92", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Spacing and card size in ui/theme/Metrics.kt. Includes cardRadius, cardMinHeight, pageHorizontal 18.dp, and headerHorizontal 24.dp. Change these instead of opening the ViewModel to restyle cards."}, {"id": "context_appstyle", "label": "appStyle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L91", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Text helper in ui/theme/Type.kt, together with AppFont. The typeface is Montserrat. Sizes are specified in DESIGN.md."}, {"id": "context_shadcn_scheme", "label": "shadcn scheme", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L90", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "palette.scheme from ui/theme/Shadcn.kt supplies background, popover, border, and card. The stored values are the DESIGN.md tokens, not a second palette."}, {"id": "context_compiledebugkotlin", "label": "compileDebugKotlin", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L165", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "After a UI edit, run gradlew.bat :app:compileDebugKotlin --offline. adb is not on PATH, so a successful compile does not mean the UI was tried on a device."}], "edges": [{"source": "context_compiledebugkotlin", "target": "github_workflows_ci_check", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L165", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "context_emobilize", "target": "design_emobilize_design_system", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "context_emobilize", "target": "context_layered_architecture", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L134", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "context_emobilize", "target": "context_compiledebugkotlin", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L165", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "context_mainactivity", "target": "context_appcontainer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L139", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "context_mainactivity", "target": "context_tasksviewmodel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L139", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "context_appcontainer", "target": "context_tasksviewmodel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CONTEXT.md", "source_location": "L139", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "context_tasksviewmodel", "target": "context_taskdraft", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score"